# Quarto build output and cache — regenerated by `quarto render`,
# never worth committing. If you've hit "phantom" render bugs that
# only go away after deleting these folders, that's exactly why:
# stale cached state in .quarto/ can persist across renders.
_book/
.quarto/

# LaTeX intermediate files, in case you ever render outside Quarto's
# own pipeline or inspect a build with `keep-tex: true` left on.
*.aux
*.log
*.lot
*.lof
*.toc
*.out
*.tex
!preamble.tex
!brand.tex
!title-page.tex
!title-page-content.tex

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
